{"id":"n80439-1-8","stage":4,"title":"턱없이 · 荒谬地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80439-1-8-1","ko":"무슨 일이야? 무척 힘들어 보여.","zh":"发生什么事了？看起来你非常辛苦啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이야?","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들어","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"9d4e17cb57a7915a","term":"무척","zh":"非常，很","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3","entryId":"55175","definition":"程度深得别的无法与之相比。","pronunciation":["무척"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/109811ebb6e799297dad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80439-1-8-2","ko":"아이가 밤새 턱없이 우는 바람에 한숨도 못 잤어.","zh":"孩子整晚哭个不停，我根本没睡一会儿觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤새","meaning":"整晚，整夜","explanation":"밤새：整晚，整夜","readings":[{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15467","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"턱없이","meaning":"荒谬地，无理地，荒唐地","explanation":"턱없이：荒谬地，无理地，荒唐地","readings":[{"term":"턱없이","audio":"/audio/687ab5907227f5439940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80439","senseId":"1","lemma":"턱없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우는","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람에","meaning":"表示后句的理由或原因。","explanation":"바람：表示后句的理由或原因。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58172","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한숨도","meaning":"一会儿，喘一口气的功夫","explanation":"한숨：一会儿，喘一口气的功夫；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85558","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잤어.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"5cc956034440dea8","term":"밤새","zh":"整晚，整夜","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3","entryId":"15467","definition":"从入夜到第二天早晨之间的时间段。","pronunciation":["밤쌔"]},{"id":"687ab5907227f543","term":"턱없이","zh":"荒谬地，无理地，荒唐地","audio":"/audio/687ab5907227f5439940.mp3","entryId":"80439","definition":"不合理或毫无依据地。","pronunciation":["터겁씨"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"表示后句的理由或原因。","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"58172","definition":"表示后句的理由或原因。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"3518247f7283983b","term":"한숨","zh":"一会儿，喘一口气的功夫","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3","entryId":"85558","definition":"指休息或睡觉的时间非常短暂。","pronunciation":["한숨"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f189f9c6c7089c0cf7c2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.949,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80439","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["孩子整晚哭个不停，我根本没睡一会儿觉。","发生什么事了？看起来你非常辛苦啊。","这次假期你做了什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["发生什么事了？看起来你非常辛苦啊。","这次假期你做了什么？","孩子整晚哭个不停，我根本没睡一会儿觉。"],"answer":2}]}
